Shortcuts 中读取 JSON 是通过 `Get Dictionary Value`

[img[https://i.imgur.com/S0Xm5EV.jpeg]]


```json
{
  "statusCode": 400,
  "statusMessage": "Bad Request",
  "message": "Human readable error message"
}
```

* Variable Name: `optional`
* Type: `Dictionary`
* Get Value for Key: your need

[img[https://i.imgur.com/oGJ1bKJ.jpeg]]

